# An unbound rule conclusion
#
# A rule recognizes that Alice knows Bob but leaves its conclusion's person
# variable unbound. Eyeron derives no new fact, illustrating how this
# unsafe conclusion is handled.

@prefix : <https://eyereasoner.github.io/eyepl/examples/check-unsafe#> .

:alice :knows :bob .

{
    :alice :knows :bob
} => {
    ?someone a :Seen
} .
